    \ 'Gender': 'Male', 'Age': 38, 'Occupation': 'Lawyer', 'Sleep Duration': 7.1,\
    \ 'Quality of Sleep': 8, 'Physical Activity Level': 60, 'Stress Level': 5, 'BMI\
